<h2 id="objective">Objective</h2>

<p>The ambition of the <a href="https://unfccc.int/fr/processus-et-reunions/l-accord-de-paris/l-accord-de-paris">Paris Agreement</a> on climate change is to reach carbon neutrality by 2050 to be as close as possible to 1.5°C and stay under 2°C of mean temperature rise of the planet.</p>
